* Marshall JCM800 2203 power amp, transcribed from the factory schematic (drawing 2203 STD,
* output stage & PSU page): long-tailed ECC83 phase inverter with the NFB/presence network,
* four EL34 as two parallel pairs, the output transformer as five coupled windings, and the HT
* supply solved together with the audio.

.nodes pin ga kc f1 f2 gb pa pb dt db bias g45 g67 s45 s67 sb pt pbm npt npb a t16 t8 bk x nb pr rv

S VAUDIO pin 50k 0
S VHT a 1 490
S VBIAS nb 54k -93.6

* Phase inverter V3: input on the first grid, feedback on the second.
C C9 pin ga 0.022u
R R17 ga f1 1M
R R16 kc f1 470
R R19 f1 gb 1M
C C15 gb f2 0.1u
R R20 f1 f2 10k
R R23 f2 0 4.7k
T V3A ga pa kc 12AX7
T V3B gb pb kc 12AX7
R R18 x pa 82k
R R21 x pb 100k
C C14 pa dt 0.022u
C C16 pb db 0.022u
C C18 dt db 47p

* Presence: C17 in series with VR6 (variable resistor) to ground, on the feedback node.
C C17 f2 pr 0.1u
R VR6 pr 0 5k

* Power-tube grid return and fixed bias.
R R24 dt bias 220k
R R25 bias db 220k
C C19 bias 0 10u
R R27 bias nb 15k
R R26 bias rv 47k
R RV1 rv 0 11k
C C20 nb 0 10u

* EL34s: each pair shares grid stoppers, screen resistors and plate load.
R R31_33 dt g45 5.6k/2
R R32_34 db g67 5.6k/2
P V4 g45 pt s45 0 EL34 2
P V5 g67 pbm s67 0 EL34 2
R R35_37 sb s45 1k/2
R R36_38 sb s67 1k/2

* Output transformer (C2668): plate-to-plate 1.9k, 3.5 H per primary half; windings are
* primary halves, then the 16R, 8R and 4R sections of the secondary (turns relative to a half).
R DCR_PT pt npt 40
R DCR_PB pbm npb 40
.param n16 = 2*1/sqrt(1900/16)
* Core saturation: SAT is the flux (volt-seconds) where the extra magnetising current equals the linear one; ~full-power
* plate-to-plate swing / (2 pi f), with f about 28-30 Hz for the large Marshall / Soldano / Peavey / Fender cores, 50 to 65 Hz for the small AC30 / tweed cores.
.xfmr OT L=3.5 SAT=4.7
  W npt a 1 pri
  W a npb 1 pri
  W t16 t8 0.2929*n16 sec
  W t8 bk 0.2071*n16 sec
  W bk 0 0.5*n16 sec
  K pri pri 0.9998
  K pri sec 0.9993
  K sec sec 0.9998
.end
R RLOAD t16 0 16

* Negative feedback from the secondary tap to the phase-inverter feedback node.
R R22 bk f2 100k

* HT supply: choke, reservoir caps, screen and preamp rails.
R T3 a sb 100
C C22 sb 0 100u
R R29 sb x 10k
C C21X x 0 50u
R RPREAMP x 0 56k
